section: ghc-internal
synopsis: Add five more primops for resizing byte arrays, relating to their pinnedness.
description: {
  Add more primops for resizing mutable byte arrays, giving five options:

  - prefer unpinned when allocating new array (``resizeMutableByteArrayPreferUnpinned#``; the ``resizeMutableByteArray#`` default)
  - prefer pinned when allocating new array (``resizeMutableByteArrayPreferPinned#``)
  - prefer aligned and pinned when allocating new array (``resizeMutableByteArrayPreferAlignedPinned#``)
  - prefer same as input bytearray when allocating new array (``resizeMutableByteArrayKeepPinnedness#``)
  - ensure the output array is aligned and pinned after operation (``resizeMutableByteArrayMakeAlignedPinned#``)

  They can be found in ``GHC.Prim`` and ``GHC.PrimOps``.
}
